    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Misterios Ocultos</strong> is a first-person horror video game that immerses you in an intense and mysterious experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jason, the host of the TV show &quot;Misterios Ocultos,&quot; is forced to venture into an abandoned hospital known as Rasto to rescue Mike, his missing reporter. What seemed like a simple rescue mission turns into a nightmare when he discovers that experiments with creatures and paranormal phenomena were being conducted in the facility, led by a mysterious doctor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dark hallways, collect key items, solve clues, and navigate oppressive environments filled with tension. You'll need to keep your composure to uncover the truth hidden in the corners of Rasto... and survive whatever lurks in the shadows.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A horror story with elements of mystery and suspense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person gameplay focused on exploration and interaction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terrifying environments and an oppressive atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medium-length gameplay, ideal for a complete experience without being overly long.</p></li></ul>",
